      "post_title": "Friday Night Singo Game",
      "post_status": "publish",
      "post_content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join us for an exciting new game night at Tamarack Resort! Singo is just like Bingo but with music! Each round is played like traditional Bingo except the spaces you are trying to fill on your Singo card are songs and you can cross off the space when the corresponding song is played. This game night is free and you can win fun Tamarack Resort swag and other prizes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come play Singo, enjoy a meal, and sip on some craft beverages from the 40+ tap wall at Seven Devils",
